     <p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">全体教工：</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 44px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">接上级文件通知，暑假期间市教育局将在全市范围内开展在职中小学教师暑假期违规补课专项治理工作，相关通知文件转发给大家，请大家认真学习贯彻文件精神，做好廉洁从教自律。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">                               <span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市第一中学</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">                                  <span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">6月28日</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市教育局关于开展</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2021年度在职中小学教师暑期</span></span></strong></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">违规补课专项治理工作的通知</span></strong></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">各区、县（市）教体局，市直学校：</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 44px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">暑假期间是在职中小学教师违规补课的高发期。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">为</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">全面贯彻落实《中共浙江省委</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-SIZE: 21px"> </span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">浙江省人民政府关于全面深化新时代教师队伍建设改革的实施意见》，</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">进一步推进</span>“<span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">清廉学校</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Verdana">”</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">建设</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">，规范教师从教行为，净化教育风气，树立教师良好形象，经研究，市教育局决定在全市范围内持续开展</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">在职中小学教师暑期违规补课专项治理工作，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 21px">一、</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 21px">加强教育，重申纪律要求</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">各地、各校要</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">在暑期放假前，</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">组织广大教师认真学习习近平总书记关于师德师风的重要论述摘编，学习</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">教育部</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">《新时代中小学教师职业行为十项准则》</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">、《严禁中小学校和在职中小学教师有偿补课的规定》、《中小学教师违反职</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">业道德行为处理办法》等政策法规和</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">市教育局《绍兴市师德考核负面清单》和《绍兴市师德失范行为处理办法（试行）》等文件要求，开展警示教育，进一步提升师德修养，</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">提高对违规补课危害性的认识和对法规法纪的敬畏。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 21px">二、加强宣传，营造舆论氛围</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">各地、各校要切实</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">增强责任意识，主动担当、主动作为，加强宣传引导，</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">组织在</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">职</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">中小学教师开展抵制暑期违规补课的师德承诺，营造良好氛围。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">各地、各校</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 22px">要</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">通过媒体、告家长书等形式向家长和社会宣传相关规定要求，公布在职教师违规补课举报电话和邮箱，</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 22px">畅通举报渠道，广泛</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">接受社会监督。</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">各地、各校</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 22px">要</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">继续完善</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">违规补课</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">网格化管理机制，及时调整网格化巡查队伍，划定责任区域，明确工作职责，落实任务要求，设立巡查日志，记载巡查情况，充分发挥网格化巡查作用，形成对违规补课行为的有效震慑与遏制。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 21px">三、加强督查，严肃正风肃纪</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">各地、各校</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">要成立专项督查小组，对暑期违规补课进行明查暗访，重点检查</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">教师有否在家或借用、租赁场地进行有偿家教、</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">违规办班；有否以父母、子女、家属或亲朋好友名义举办培训班，参与教学或管理；有否教师之间相互介绍学生为对方提供违规补课、有偿家教生源；有否利用微信朋友圈、家长</span>QQ群等平台为校外培训机构和他人提供宣传服务、推荐生源；有否到培训机构兼课兼职，特别是在异地培训机构交叉兼课兼职；有否利用职务之便，违背家长和学生意愿，诱导、暗示、动员或强制学生参加违规补课、有偿家教。各地、各校对违规补课行为，要坚决发现一起、查处一起、曝光一起；对违规补课的教师，责令其立即停止违规行为，清退违规所得，扣发绩效工资，当年度不得参与岗位晋级、职称晋升、评优评先等，并视情节轻重，分别给予批评教育、诫勉谈话、责令检查、通报批评，直至</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">相应的行政处分。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 44px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 22px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">四、加强监管，从快核实通报</span>  </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 44px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">各地、各校对于接到的举报投诉以及上级转办的举报投诉，要从快调查核实、固定证据，从快处置通报，绝不姑息，起到警示作用。对暑期违规补课部署不及时、执行不坚决、监管不到位，以及问题频发、社会反响强烈的区、县（市）和市直学校，要在年度教育工作业绩考核中扣除相应分数。</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 44px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">附件：</span>1.</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 21px">习近平总书记关于师德师风的重要论述摘编</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px; TEXT-INDENT: 110px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">2.2021年度市直学校教师暑期辅导情况登记表</span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px"> </span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">                               </span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">绍兴市教育</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">局</span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">                              </span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 22px">2021年6月24日</span></p><p><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 14px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16px"><img style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2px" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106291003278540.gif" /><a title="202106291003009248.pdf" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106291003009248.pdf" target="_self">附件1.pdf</a>
</p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16px"><img style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2px" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106291005124396.gif" /><a title="202106291004345094.doc" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/6/202106291004345094.doc" target="_self">附件2.doc</a></p><p>
</p>
    
